  "description": "Alterations and extension to roof to form end gable; rear dormer; two rooflights in front roof slope to create habitable roof space for first floor flat; external alterations&nbsp;&nbsp;(demolition of side dormer)",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": "Pinner South",
  "last_updated": "2026-10-06T09:58:49.446Z",
  "street_name": "VILLAGE WAY EAST",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed roof extensions, by virtue of their size, siting and design, would result in an addition that is unduly obtrusive and incongruous to the original building, failing to respect its character and proportion, and the visual amenities of the locality. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the high-quality design aspiration of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policies D3, D4 of The London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow’s Local Plan (2021-2041) and the relevant provisions of the adopted Harrow Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
